{
  "name": "GRC evidence: Microsoft Entra ID",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8f780c76-6acd-5821-b46f-96c1eb765368",
      "name": "Every day at 06:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "05c601cb-3b13-536e-8ee3-38b18f789508",
              "name": "graph_url",
              "value": "https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "9e8e4e5b-1dc2-5f56-8e55-4847ce9ef1b4",
              "name": "tenant",
              "value": "your-tenant-name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "946df8a9-ae73-569f-a27d-98ae610807da",
              "name": "grc_url",
              "value": "https://grc.yourcompany.example",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1ae0a700-4cae-5116-8042-88b07fc89bde",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "EDIT THESE VALUES. grc_url is the address of your GRC platform.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.graph_url }}/reports/authenticationMethods/userRegistrationDetails?$select=userPrincipalName,userType,isAdmin,isMfaCapable,isMfaRegistered&$top=500",
        "options": {
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "paginationMode": "responseContainsNextURL",
              "nextURL": "={{ $response.body['@odata.nextLink'] }}",
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ !$response.body['@odata.nextLink'] }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 200
            }
          }
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "oAuth2Api"
      },
      "id": "0c945b88-306f-5f34-99de-6e118ed73d6b",
      "name": "Registration details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Each input item is one page of the report.\nconst users = $input.all().flatMap(p => p.json.value || []);\nif (!users.length) throw new Error('Microsoft Graph returned no users. Check the AuditLog.Read.All permission and the Entra ID licence.');\nreturn [{ json: { checks: ['entra_mfa_capable', 'entra_admin_mfa'], source_ref: 'Entra tenant ' + $('Settings').first().json.tenant + ' (n8n)',\n  items: users.map(u => ({ user: u.userPrincipalName, user_type: u.userType, is_admin: !!u.isAdmin, mfa_capable: !!u.isMfaCapable, mfa_registered: !!u.isMfaRegistered })) } }];"
      },
      "id": "21f3fd29-cf61-59cd-a3fc-b8a1148f7a2e",
      "name": "Shape users",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.grc_url }}/api/integrations/collect",
        "options": {},
        "method": "POST",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
      },
      "id": "74592e47-9311-5263-8dac-adef99c02fa2",
      "name": "Send users to GRC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GRC evidence: Microsoft Entra ID\n1. Edit **Settings**.\n2. On *Registration details* choose an **OAuth2 API** credential: Grant Type *Client Credentials*, Access Token URL `https://login.microsoftonline.com/<tenant-id>/oauth2/v2.0/token`, Scope `https://graph.microsoft.com/.default`, Authentication *Body*. The app registration needs only the application permission **AuditLog.Read.All**.\n3. On *Send users to GRC* choose a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <GRC API token>`.\n4. The report needs Entra ID P1 or P2 and omits disabled users.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "30e04703-5bf6-5258-ab90-6007bfa6f0be",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -20
      ]
    }
  ],
